          overline="Questions"
          title="MORE DETAILS ABOUT THE PROGRAM"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3" data-reveal-stagger>
        <FaqItem question="Will I learn to make art in this program?">
          <p>Build it Remarkable is intended for artists who are already proficient and know their style and have already started a creative business. We do NOT learn how to make art in the program, we learn how to leverage our talent to build a Creative Educator Business.</p>
        </FaqItem>

        <FaqItem question="Will I learn how to sell my art?">
          <p>This Program does not teach methods to sell art or get into galleries. We learn how to build and market an educator business using your expertise to create courses, a membership, workshops and collaborations, and we will reinforce the skills needed to sell better than ever before through your own uniquely designed offers.</p>
        </FaqItem>

        <FaqItem question="Will I learn how to create a digital course?">
          <p>You will learn the foundation to building a business, including how to design the perfect offer. While we might discuss what is possible for tech and course hosting, this program does NOT specifically go into tech. We do provide a tech bundle course as a bonus.</p>
        </FaqItem>

        <FaqItem question="I'm not a visual artist, will this work for me?">
          <p>Build it Remarkable is a one-of-a-kind creative business accelerator that will give ANY creative expert the foundation they need. It doesn't matter your medium &mdash; if you are ready to think outside the box and build something truly remarkable, then this is the program for you!</p>
        </FaqItem>

        <FaqItem question="What if I can't make the calls or workshops?">
          <p>We record all masterclasses and coaching calls and will keep all trainings indefinitely. We create a variety of times and days for calls in hopes that you'll find an event that matches your schedule.</p>
        </FaqItem>

        <FaqItem question="How long do I get to keep the content?">
          <p>You get lifetime access to all the CORE content, such as the modules and bonuses and any updates we make. Coaching or meetup calls kept for a minimum of 3 months.</p>
        </FaqItem>

        <FaqItem question="How many people will be accepted into the program?">
          <p>This program has limited enrollment. We will cut off the first cohort of 2026 at a maximum of 80 new Builders.</p>
        </FaqItem>

        <FaqItem question="What if I don't know what kind of business I want yet?">
          <p>Do you have an expertise in something creative? Are you proficient in your passion? Then there's no doubt we can extract your genius and put together a great business plan. You don't have to have it all figured out, you just have to start!</p>
        </FaqItem>

        <FaqItem question="Do I get access to all the content as soon as I join?">
          <p>We are teaching Build it Remarkable LIVE again this year! Most content is dripped out over time. You get instant access to Jumpstart lessons, the Tech Bundle, and the community.</p>
        </FaqItem>

        <FaqItem question="How much is the investment?">
          <p>Currently Build it Remarkable is a 12 month program and the investment is only $2400 USD for a whole year of training and support!</p>
        </FaqItem>

        <FaqItem question="Is this really a good time to be running a business?">
          <p>There's no time like right now. Taking control of your future and helping others find art is a big way you can make a difference.</p>
        </FaqItem>

        <FaqItem question="What if I want a refund?">
          <p>We have a case by case refund policy. If you decide within the first 14 days that this is not your ideal fit, please show you have watched lessons and done homework. We have a $100 refund service fee.</p>
        </FaqItem>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


